flowchart LR
    client[Client or .NET wrapper] -->|Submit request| api[FastAPI]
    api -->|Create queued job| job[(TenderDocumentsProcessingJobRMQ)]
    api -.->|Publish message| queue[tender.processing queue]
    queue -.->|Consume message| worker[Tender processing worker]
    worker --> flow[Orchestration flow]
    flow --> result[(MongoDB and Qdrant)]
    flow --> status[Update job status]
